    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a mix of fascination and frustration for me. I appreciate its logical structure and how it applies to real-world problems, especially in physics, which I enjoy. However, my vocational education didn't delve deep into advanced math, so some topics feel challenging or abstract. I see it more as a tool than an end goal.",
