    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve experimented with AI tools like Wolfram Alpha for quick calculations or explanations. It’s been helpful for verifying my work, especially in physics-related problems. However, I prefer understanding the ‘why’ behind solutions rather than relying solely on AI for answers.",
